    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga, Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba na Jehu mwana wa Hanani kuhusu Baasha achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“We Baasha, mino nákuunula kula vumbini, nchikuhenda chilongozi wa atu angu, Aiziraeli. Nawe ukalunga mwendo wa Jeroboamu. Ukaahenda atu angu Aiziraeli anikosere ahende dambi na kunireyeza kpwa dambi zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, uwe Baasha ndakuangamiza tsetsetse phamwenga na nyumbayo. Tsona, ndaihenda nyumbayo ikale dza vira nirivyohenda nyumba ya Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu yeyesi wa nyumbayo ndiyefwerera ndani ya mudzi, andariwa ni madiya na yeyesi ndiyefwerera mundani, andariwa ni nyama a mapha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahendo ganjina gosi ga Baasha na usujaawe, waandikpwa kpwenye chitabu cha Kumbukumbu za afalume a Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha wafwa, achizikpwa hiko Tirisa, mwanawe Ela achitawala badalaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba tsona kutsupira nabii Jehu mwana wa Hanani kuhusu Baasha na nyumbaye kpwa sababu ya mai arigohenda mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Baasha wamtsukiza Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa mahendoge. Waiga Jeroboamu na nyumbaye na kuisababisha nyumbaye iaangamizwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa mirongo miiri na sita wa utawala wa Asa mfalume wa Juda, Ela mwana wa Baasha waandza kutawala Iziraeli kula Tirisa. Watawala muda wa miaka miiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Zimuri, mkpwuluwe wa jeshi ambaye kala ni muimirizi wa nusu ya kundi ra magarige ga kuvwehwa ni farasi wampangira njama mbii. Siku mwenga, mfalume Ela ariphokala hiko Tirisa ndani ya nyumba ya Arisa ariyekala muimirizi wa nyumba ya mfalume, wanwa, achilewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Zimuri wainjira ndani achimpiga Ela hadi achimuolaga na achitawala badalaye. Hinyo wakala mwaka wa mirongo miiri na sabaa wa utawala wa Asa mfalume wa Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara tu ariphoandza kutawala, Zimuri waaolaga atu osi a Nyumba ya Baasha. Kayaricha hata mlume mmwenga wa nyumbaye wala asenae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa gakala dza vyo Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyogomba kuhusu atu osi a Baasha, kutsupira nabii Jehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mambo higa gahendeka kpwa sababu ya dambi zosi za Baasha na mwanawe Ela. Amreyeza Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli, kpwa kuahenda Aiziraeli ahende dambi kpwa vizuka vyao visivyo mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mambo ganjina ga Ela na gosi arigohenda gaandikpwa kpwenye Chitabu cha Kumbukumbu za afalume a Iziraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa mirongo miiri na sabaa wa utawala wa Asa mfalume wa Juda, Zimuri waitawala Iziraeli hiko Tirisa kpwa muda wa siku sabaa bahi. Jeshi ra Iziraeli kala rikapiga kambi ili kushambuliya Gibethoni mudzi wa Afilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati anajeshi a Iziraeli ariphosikira kukala Zimuri akaasi na kumuolaga mfalume, osi amuika Omuri, mkpwulu wa jeshi, kukala mfalume wa Iziraeli siku iyo-iyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri na Aiziraeli osi auka kula Gibethoni, achiphiya kpwendashambuliya mudzi wa Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zimuri ariphoona kukala mudzi ukahalwa, wainjira ngomeni mwa nyumba ya mfalume, achiitiya moho naye achifwerera mumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzambo hiro rahendeka kpwa sababu ya dambi arizohenda. Wahenda mai mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Walunga mwendo wa Jeroboamu na kuasababisha Aiziraeli amkosere Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahendo ganjina ga Zimuri na makosage gosi gaandikpwa kpwenye chitabu cha Kumbukumbu za afalume a Iziraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho, Aiziraeli aganyika makundi mairi: kundi mwenga ramuunga mkpwono Tibuni mwana wa Ginathi kukala akale mfalume wao na kundi ra phiri richimuunga mkpwono Omuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu a kundi ririromuunga mkpwono Omuri aturya hara ariomuunga mkpwono Tibuni mwana wa Ginathi. Phahi, Tibuni wafwa na Omuri achikala mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri waandza kutawala Iziraeli mwaka wa mirongo mihahu na mwenga wa utawala wa Asa mfalume wa Juda. Watawala muda wa miaka kumi na miiri. Miaka sita watawala kula mudzi wa Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagula mwango wa Samariya kpwa talanta mbiri za feza kula kpwa mutu mmwenga yeihwa Shemeri na dzulu ya mwango hinyo, achidzenga mudzi wenye kuta. Mudzi wenye wauiha Samariya, kpwa ishima ya Shemeri ariyekala mwenye mwango hinyo pho mwandzo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri wahenda mai mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Wahenda mai zaidi ya hara osi ariomtanguliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walunga mwendo wa Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati na makosage ga kuahenda Aiziraeli amkosere Mlungu. Wamtsukiza Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli, kpwa kuabudu vizuka visivyo mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahendo ganjina ga Omuri na usujaawe, gosi arigohenda gaandikpwa kpwenye chitabu cha Kumbukumbu za afalume a Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.27",
